# "sync pad" and "sync stab" on the chord track: a four-note chord, a five-note chord that steals a voice (host
# fade, stage 5), then the ratio swept while a chord holds, then short stabs.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 3.0
track chord
preset 70 60 100 150 220 110 0 0 128 0 128 160 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C3 8 100
note 0 G3 8 100
note 0 C4 8 100
note 0 E4 8 100
note 8 A2 8 110
note 8 E3 8 110
note 8 A3 8 110
note 8 C4 8 110
note 8 E4 8 110
sweep p1 70 220 8 16
param p1 120 16
param p2 30 16
param attack 0 16
param decay 50 16
param sustain 0 16
param release 40 16
note 16 F3 2 127
note 16 A3 2 127
note 16 C4 2 127
note 20 G3 2 127
note 20 B3 2 127
note 20 D4 2 127
note 24 E3 2 127
note 24 G3 2 127
note 24 B3 2 127
note 24 E4 2 127
expect sound 0 28
expect idle 50
expect peak_below -1
